     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);border:none;line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Tomorrow (Fri 3/13) at D-RUG, we’ll have a tutorial from Myfanwy Johnston on ggplot2, a powerful package for creating both fast exploratory plots and beautiful, publication-quality ones.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Also, <em>we have a room change</em>.  We’ll be in <strong>Plant and Environmental Sciences 2005 from 10-12</strong>. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">We’ll screencast the talk here: <a href=\"http://goo.gl/0gQdIa\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl/0gQdIa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468349175000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0BytwdXLLw6mEsVeUNonXK\">http://goo.gl/0gQdIa</a> . Video, code and materials from the talk will be posted on the blog afterwards.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Per usual, Myfanwy’s presentation + Q&amp;A will run from 10-11, and we’ll have open work times 11-12.  And I think I’ll bring the Thin Mints this week.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">This will be the last D-RUG session of the quarter.  Watch out for a survey for spring meeting times. </p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SGkgYWxsLDxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+VG9tb3Jyb3cgKEZyaSAzLzEzKSBhdCBELVJVRywg\r\nd2UnbGwgaGF2ZSBhIHR1dG9yaWFsIGZyb20gTXlmYW53eSBKb2huc3RvbiBvbiBnZ3Bsb3QyLCBh\r\nIHBvd2VyZnVsIHBhY2thZ2UgZm9yIGNyZWF0aW5nIGJvdGggZmFzdCBleHBsb3JhdG9yeSBwbG90\r\ncyBhbmQgYmVhdXRpZnVsLCBwdWJsaWNhdGlvbi1xdWFsaXR5IG9uZXMuPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+\r\nPC9kaXY+PGRpdj5BbHNvLCAqd2UgaGF2ZSBhIHJvb20gY2hhbmdlKi4gJm5ic3A7V2UnbGwgYmUg\r\naW4gKipQbGFudCBhbmQgRW52aXJvbm1lbnRhbCBTY2llbmNlcyAyMDA1IGZyb20gMTAtMTIqKi4m\r\nbmJzcDs8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PjxiciBjbGFzcz0iQXBwbGUtaW50ZXJjaGFuZ2UtbmV3bGluZSI+V2Un\r\nbGwgc2NyZWVuY2FzdCB0aGUgdGFsay